{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2022-01-19 06:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE OPENS FIRST CLOUD REGION IN AFRICA', 'text': 'JOHANNESBURG, JAN. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE TODAY ANNOUNCED THE AVAILABILITY OF ITS FIRST CLOUD REGION IN AFRICA TO MEET THE RAPIDLY GROWING DEMAND FOR ENTERPRISE CLOUD SERVICES ON\xa0THE CONTINENT. THE\xa0ORACLE CLOUD JOHANNESBURG\xa0REGION WILL BOOST CLOUD ADOPTION ACROSS AFRICA WHILE ALSO HELPING BUSINESSES ACHIEVE BETTER PERFORMANCE AND DRIVE CONTINUOUS INNOVATION.'}